paper_data/
results/

# Paper: ignore manuscripts, cover letters and LaTeX build artifacts, but KEEP the
# reproducibility layer the manuscript cites (data generators, benchmark data,
# experimental datasets) so every path referenced in the paper resolves in a clean
# checkout. Note: this must be "paper/*", not "paper/" -- git cannot re-include a
# file whose parent directory is itself excluded.
paper/*
!paper/*.clj
!paper/*.sh
!paper/*.json
!paper/*.edn
!paper/*.md
# ...except this stale Feb-2026 draft (placeholder author names, predates the
# resonance-transfer work). Keep it out of the citable artifact.
paper/mdpi_proceedings_manuscript.md

